# foundry - syncopated kick, metallic hats, dark bass
bpm 140
swing 14
humanize kick 5
humanize hat 5
humanize oh 5
humanize clap 5
humanize snare 5
humanize perc 5
humanize bass 5
humanize stab 5
kick X..X..X..X..X...
hat x.x.x.xx.x.x.xx.
filter hat hp 11000
tune hat 11000
snare ........x.......
perc x.x.x..x.x.x..x.
tune perc 210
bass e1! f1! e1 d1 e1 d1 b0 b1~ b0! b1~ c2 b1 a1 b1 a1! a0!
filter bass lp 300 res 0.92
sidechain bass 0.8
